<Slide>
    <Box style={{
        width: '100%',
        height: '100%',
        background: '#FFFFFF',
        padding: '0 70px',
        position: 'relative',
    }}>
        {/* A 区：标题块 */}
        <Box style={{
            height: 110,
            flexDirection: 'column',
            justifyContent: 'center',
            borderBottom: '2px solid #E2E8F0',
            gap: 6,
        }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
                <Box style={{
                    background: '#DBEAFE',
                    borderRadius: 4,
                    padding: '3px 10px',
                }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#1E40AF', fontWeight: 600 }}>PAPER 02 · Benchmark + Agent</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{
                    background: '#1E40AF',
                    borderRadius: 4,
                    padding: '3px 10px',
                }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>ACL 2026</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{
                    background: '#FFF7ED',
                    borderRadius: 4,
                    padding: '3px 10px',
                    border: '1px solid #FFEDD5',
                }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#F97316', fontWeight: 600 }}>48★ · 40 引 · 量子位</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>
                LearnAct: Few-Shot Mobile GUI Agent
            </Text>
        </Box>

        {/* B 区：上双栏 + 下三栏 */}
        <Box style={{
            height: 550,
            flexDirection: 'column',
            paddingTop: 18,
            paddingBottom: 16,
            gap: 12,
        }}>
            {/* 上部：左文字 + 右图 */}
            <Box style={{
                flex: 1.3,
                flexDirection: 'row',
                gap: 20,
            }}>
                {/* 左：痛点 + 方法 */}
                <Box style={{
                    flex: 1,
                    flexDirection: 'column',
                    gap: 10,
                }}>
                    <Box style={{
                        background: '#FEF2F2',
                        borderRadius: 10,
                        padding: '10px 14px',
                        border: '1px solid #FECACA',
                    }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#991B1B', fontWeight: 600, marginBottom: 4 }}>
                            痛点 · 为什么少样本学习
                        </Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
                            Google Play 有 <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>168 万</span>应用，长尾场景无法被预训练数据覆盖；agent 在未见 UI 上泛化差，需要<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>无需梯度更新</span>的少样本适配。
                        </Text>
                    </Box>

                    <Box style={{
                        background: '#F8FAFC',
                        borderRadius: 10,
                        padding: '10px 14px',
                        border: '1px solid #E2E8F0',
                        flex: 1,
                    }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#1E40AF', fontWeight: 600, marginBottom: 6 }}>
                            方法 · 三 Agent 流水线（知识生成 → 检索 → 执行）
                        </Text>
                        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 5 }}>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                                <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E40AF' }}>DemoParser</span> · 把坐标级动作（CLICK[123,456]）转成语义描述 "[On Screen], [Action], to [Purpose]"，带 memory 机制支撑跨步信息
                            </Text>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                                <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E40AF' }}>KnowSeeker</span> · 用 all-MiniLM-L6-v2 预计算知识 embedding，运行时仅做 cosine top-k 检索（含阈值），保证知识库可扩展
                            </Text>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                                <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E40AF' }}>ActExecutor</span> · POMDP 策略 π: O×D→A，融合指令+截图+历史+演示，Perception→Decision→Action 三段循环
                            </Text>
                        </Box>
                    </Box>
                </Box>

                {/* 右：主图 */}
                <Box style={{
                    flex: 1.1,
                    flexDirection: 'column',
                    gap: 8,
                }}>
                    <Box style={{
                        flex: 1,
                        background: '#F8FAFC',
                        borderRadius: 12,
                        border: '1px solid #E2E8F0',
                        overflow: 'hidden',
                        padding: 10,
                        alignItems: 'center',
                        justifyContent: 'center',
                    }}>
                        <Image
                            src="assets/learnact-teaser.png"
                            style={{
                                width: '100%',
                                height: '100%',
                                objectFit: 'contain',
                            }}
                        />
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{
                        background: '#FFF7ED',
                        borderRadius: 8,
                        padding: '8px 12px',
                        border: '1px solid #FFEDD5',
                    }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#9A3412', lineHeight: 1.5, textAlign: 'center' }}>
                            LearnGUI 涵盖 2,252 offline + 101 online 任务，覆盖长尾 app
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            {/* 下部：三栏横条 */}
            <Box style={{
                flex: 1,
                flexDirection: 'row',
                gap: 12,
            }}>
                {/* 关键对比 */}
                <Box style={{
                    flex: 1,
                    background: '#FFF7ED',
                    borderRadius: 10,
                    padding: '12px 14px',
                    border: '1px solid #FFEDD5',
                    flexDirection: 'column',
                }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#9A3412', fontWeight: 600, marginBottom: 6 }}>
                        关键结果（单条演示）
                    </Text>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4, flex: 1 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                            · Gemini-1.5-Pro 0-shot <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F97316' }}>19.3%</span> → 1-shot <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F97316' }}>51.7%</span> → 3-shot 57.7%（+198.9%）
                        </Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                            · UI-TARS-7B-SFT 在线 SR 18.1% → <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F97316' }}>32.8%</span>，逼近 GPT-4o 34.5%
                        </Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                            · 7B+LearnAct 超过 Claude Computer-Use (27.9%) 与 Aguvis-72B (26.1%)
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>

                {/* 消融 */}
                <Box style={{
                    flex: 1,
                    background: '#F8FAFC',
                    borderRadius: 10,
                    padding: '12px 14px',
                    border: '1px solid #E2E8F0',
                    flexDirection: 'column',
                }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#1E40AF', fontWeight: 600, marginBottom: 6 }}>
                        消融发现
                    </Text>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4, flex: 1 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                            · 完整 51.7% → 去 DemoParser <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F97316' }}>40.6%</span>（-11.1）→ 去 KnowSeeker <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F97316' }}>41.6%</span>（-10.1）
                        </Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                            · Signal 上 DemoParser 更关键（复杂交互依赖语义描述）；ToDo 上 KnowSeeker 更关键（任务类型多变）
                        </Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                            · Action 相似性可补偿 UI 差异：UI_SL·Act_SH 上 match +38.4%
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>

                {/* 贡献 */}
                <Box style={{
                    flex: 1,
                    background: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #1E40AF 0%, #3B82F6 100%)',
                    borderRadius: 10,
                    padding: '12px 14px',
                    flexDirection: 'column',
                }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#BFDBFE', fontWeight: 600, marginBottom: 6 }}>
                        核心贡献
                    </Text>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4, flex: 1 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                            首个 demonstration-learning 移动 GUI benchmark
                        </Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                            知识生成-检索-执行三 agent 范式
                        </Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                            无需梯度更新让 7B 模型逼近 GPT-4o
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        {/* C 区：页脚 */}
        <Box style={{
            height: 60,
            flexDirection: 'row',
            justifyContent: 'space-between',
            alignItems: 'center',
            borderTop: '1px solid #E2E8F0',
        }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>
                Guangyi Liu · ZJU · 面试陈述
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>
                11 / 15
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
